---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Accessibility Statement | Findable Home"
    description="Learn about Findable Home's accessibility goals, ongoing improvement efforts, and how to report an accessibility barrier."
>
    <main class="min-h-screen bg-base-200/40">
        <header class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-100">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
                <div class="max-w-3xl">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">
                        OUR COMMITMENT
                    </span>
                    <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-base-content sm:text-5xl">
                        Accessibility Statement
                    </h1>
                    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-base-content/70">
                        We want Findable Home to be useful and welcoming to
                        as many people as possible. Accessibility is an
                        ongoing effort, and your feedback helps us improve.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-base-content/70">
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">Effective: October 10, 2026</span>
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">Updated: October 10, 2026</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-8 h-1 w-20 rounded-full bg-secondary"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-5 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 border-l-4 border-l-primary bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">Our Accessibility Goals</h2>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                    Findable Home publishes practical household organization,
                    storage, and renter-friendly content. We want visitors
                    to be able to navigate our website, understand our
                    information, and explore relevant resources with as few
                    barriers as reasonably possible.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                    We recognize that accessibility needs vary. We aim to
                    improve the experience for people with different
                    abilities, devices, browsing methods, and assistive
                    technologies.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">Our Ongoing Efforts</h2>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                    As we maintain and develop Findable Home, we aim to
                    consider accessibility in areas such as:
                </p>
                <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-7 marker:text-primary">
                    <li>Clear headings and a logical content structure.</li>
                    <li>Readable text and consistent navigation.</li>
                    <li>Descriptive link text and meaningful image alternatives where appropriate.</li>
                    <li>Keyboard access to interactive elements where supported.</li>
                    <li>Color contrast and visible interaction states.</li>
                    <li>Responsive layouts across different screen sizes.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                    These are goals for ongoing work, not a claim that every
                    page or feature currently satisfies every accessibility
                    requirement. We have not established through this
                    statement alone that the entire website has been
                    independently audited or verified against a particular standard.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">Known Limitations</h2>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                    Website features, third-party services, embedded content,
                    and external links may not offer the same level of
                    accessibility. Some issues may arise from software,
                    content, or services outside our direct control.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                    We may not identify every barrier before a visitor
                    encounters it. Reports from visitors help us understand
                    problems that need attention.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">Reporting an Accessibility Barrier</h2>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                    If you have difficulty accessing a page, reading content,
                    navigating the website, or using a feature, please let
                    us know. We welcome reports about barriers, suggestions
                    for improvement, and requests for information in a more
                    accessible format where reasonably possible.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                    When contacting us, it helps to include the page address,
                    a description of the problem, and the device, browser,
                    or assistive technology involved if you are comfortable
                    sharing those details. Please do not include passwords
                    or other sensitive personal information.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                    We will review reports and consider appropriate next
                    steps. We cannot guarantee a particular resolution time,
                    but feedback is appreciated.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 shadow-sm">
                <div class="h-1.5 bg-primary"></div>
                <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">We welcome your feedback</span>
                    <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">Contact Findable Home</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        To report an accessibility issue or suggest an
                        improvement, contact us by email.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-5">
                        <p class="font-bold">Findable Home</p>
                        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Email us at</p>
                        <a href="mailto:contact@findablehome.me" class="mt-1 inline-block break-all font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4">
                            contact@findablehome.me
                        </a>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">
                            <a href="https://findablehome.me/" class="link link-primary">findablehome.me</a>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">Updates to This Statement</h2>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                    We may update this statement as our website changes
                    and accessibility work progresses. The latest version
                    will be published on this page with an updated date.
                </p>
            </section>

            <p class="px-1 py-3 text-center text-sm text-base-content/60">
                Thank you for helping us make Findable Home easier to use.
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>

